{
    "word": "rattletrap",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "8befcfd7-e144-3a6e-a810-6685bec4ba02",
                "word": "rattletrap",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fdeeb625-f1d4-3a4c-adb4-5e17b1bbf871",
                        "entry_id": "8befcfd7-e144-3a6e-a810-6685bec4ba02",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Mechanically unreliable or in disrepair."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "de0bfe4d-ec01-4e1a-94e5-b39e03cab765",
                                "sense_id": "fdeeb625-f1d4-3a4c-adb4-5e17b1bbf871",
                                "text": "2006, Paul McGeough, Bush 'palace' shielded from Iraqi storm, theage.com.au, August 26, http://www.theage.com.au/news/world/bush-palace-shielded-from-iraqi-storm/2006/08/25/1156012740594.html,\nAll services for the biggest embassy in the world will operate independently from the rattletrap utilities of the Iraqi capital. (speaking of the new US Embassy in Baghdad)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2c04922f-243d-4ce3-90af-1bf95e5ba861",
                                "sense_id": "fdeeb625-f1d4-3a4c-adb4-5e17b1bbf871",
                                "text": "Every cultural instinct and previous experience tells you that when you travel this far you should find, at the very least, people on camels. There should be unrecognizable lettering on the signs, and swarthy men in robes drinking coffee from thimble-sized cups and puffing on hookahs, and rattletrap buses and potholes in the road and a real possibility of disease on everything you touch—but no, it's not like that at all."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ab8c32f-bec2-4862-8fe3-7e9809bc9afe",
                                "sense_id": "fdeeb625-f1d4-3a4c-adb4-5e17b1bbf871",
                                "text": "BLANCHE:What you are talking about is brutal desire--just--Desire!--the name of that rattle-trap streetcar that bangs through the Quarter, up one old narrow street and down another..."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "bf075cee-d577-389f-b6ef-8e440a9c99e7",
                "word": "rattletrap",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "5da10cd8-c493-4613-a450-0d49919f15a5",
                        "entry_id": "bf075cee-d577-389f-b6ef-8e440a9c99e7",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "rattletraps"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7c349fc8-1c01-365c-b071-a11d17090a5e",
                        "entry_id": "bf075cee-d577-389f-b6ef-8e440a9c99e7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A mechanical device, particularly an automobile, that is worn out, run down, or mechanically unreliable as indicated by noises it makes in operation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "417ebff0-0f9a-4476-9bc9-ead7368beb56",
                                "sense_id": "7c349fc8-1c01-365c-b071-a11d17090a5e",
                                "text": "Mom always worried about our safety in my friend's rattletrap. I told her not to worry, as it can't go fast enough to be dangerous."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c64f379c-7be0-3ee0-afe5-380fbe4e684b",
                        "entry_id": "bf075cee-d577-389f-b6ef-8e440a9c99e7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any piece of miscellaneous equipment or junk."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba76ee41-02a5-4868-9f5b-9b7b315c60f5",
                                "sense_id": "c64f379c-7be0-3ee0-afe5-380fbe4e684b",
                                "text": "And they tumbled about the rattletraps under the cupboard, and rummaged the drawers in search of the sacred volume."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0ac81f5a-0b3f-3baf-9e2c-33ee227a9e46",
                        "entry_id": "bf075cee-d577-389f-b6ef-8e440a9c99e7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A type of noisemaker in which the teeth of a gear repeatedly bend and release a stiff tongue."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "acb4b583-0388-31a6-881c-790d5a38c20f",
                        "entry_id": "bf075cee-d577-389f-b6ef-8e440a9c99e7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person's mouth."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated",
                            "derogatory",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d9f39410-4cfd-46e9-bf6c-4757f1fae993",
                                "sense_id": "acb4b583-0388-31a6-881c-790d5a38c20f",
                                "text": "Shut your rattletrap!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "22f3ae6d-74ae-49ef-80b1-89c3c8d38377",
                        "source_entry_id": "bf075cee-d577-389f-b6ef-8e440a9c99e7",
                        "source_sense_description": "unreliable mechanical device",
                        "target_lang_word": "tacot",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tacot",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "89b87335-f8af-3743-9238-412023f7c3ce",
                                        "entry_id": "ebfcb1e6-3af7-36da-bf5b-bd8681601ef4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bout de bois."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf03f6c0-4799-4c27-b796-60b67b394a02",
                                                "sense_id": "89b87335-f8af-3743-9238-412023f7c3ce",
                                                "text": "On appelle tacot les pointes acérées des arbustes qui dépassent du sol après une coupe mécanique comme celle d'un rotovateur par exemple."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d159bc41-6309-3d1d-8374-f2b6d109c253",
                                        "entry_id": "ebfcb1e6-3af7-36da-bf5b-bd8681601ef4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Petit verre d’alcool."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "03c5b7d8-9b46-3d2f-9443-7d7b31661f7d",
                                        "entry_id": "ebfcb1e6-3af7-36da-bf5b-bd8681601ef4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Taxi."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "pejorative",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "848930f4-9e37-4e7d-94f8-c18f200dfc28",
                                                "sense_id": "03c5b7d8-9b46-3d2f-9443-7d7b31661f7d",
                                                "text": "Mais, tout de même, il prendrait le tacot, au Luxembourg, et pousserait une pointe jusqu’à Bourg-la-Reine ; […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd947d98-6e3d-4867-a905-596ac304b5b3",
                                                "sense_id": "03c5b7d8-9b46-3d2f-9443-7d7b31661f7d",
                                                "text": "Je rejoins mon tacot, je le laisse se baguenauder cinq minutes, puis je m’arrête devant un petit hôtel […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7700baac-c238-3546-b463-8eb272f81da5",
                                        "entry_id": "ebfcb1e6-3af7-36da-bf5b-bd8681601ef4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vieille voiture en mauvais état qui fonctionne mal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar",
                                            "pejorative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c12f95a8-8ff4-4d42-9490-6aa872890329",
                                                "sense_id": "7700baac-c238-3546-b463-8eb272f81da5",
                                                "text": "Ils tètent un lait abondant, mais qu’il leur faut acheter par des acrobaties au-dessus de leur âge. Pati-Pati n’a rien de ces lices vautrées, tout en ventre et en tétines, qui s’absorbent, béates, en leur tâche auguste. Elle allaite assise, contraignant ses chiots à l’attitude du mécanicien aplati sous le tacot en panne."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cbb912b6-362d-3111-8b32-12a53c7b092e",
                                        "entry_id": "ebfcb1e6-3af7-36da-bf5b-bd8681601ef4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mécanisme qui donne l’impulsion à la navette dans les métiers à tisser."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a20f9180-da96-4fcc-8d3b-e4e40ce05d6f",
                                                "sense_id": "cbb912b6-362d-3111-8b32-12a53c7b092e",
                                                "text": "Tacot, ou chasse-navette, outil qui met en mouvement la navette Volante des métiers mécaniques."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "78f05213-43ed-3b13-80da-6ad469cd56c7",
                                        "entry_id": "ebfcb1e6-3af7-36da-bf5b-bd8681601ef4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Petit tronçon de chemin de fer d’intérêt local, régional."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50a2a454-94df-4895-a0ae-27e85e55628d",
                                                "sense_id": "78f05213-43ed-3b13-80da-6ad469cd56c7",
                                                "text": "J’allai prendre le petit chemin de fer d’intérêt local dont j’avais, par Albertine et ses amies, appris autrefois tous les surnoms dans la région, où on l’appelait tantôt le Tortillard à cause de ses innombrables détours, le Tacot parce qu’il n’avançait pas […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb3a6e16-3ecf-472a-8c13-7a614f1acbc3",
                                                "sense_id": "78f05213-43ed-3b13-80da-6ad469cd56c7",
                                                "text": "Voire péjorativement pour les trains des lignes secondaires : tortillard, brouette, tacot, patachon, bouzine, etc."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dffe06e1-9e6c-325c-9c12-edb7a14a5b8f",
                                        "entry_id": "ebfcb1e6-3af7-36da-bf5b-bd8681601ef4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Caisse à savon, petit véhicule monoplace sans moteur mu par gravité."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Québec"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "tacot",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "49bfb3f7-7175-3073-b4e1-bbbcf69da878",
                                        "entry_id": "874c715a-8e88-3509-b2a3-6a9547a9d261",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Battoir utilisé par les lavandières pour taper le linge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Bourgogne"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e451732b-49bd-4bc9-bf86-276119588bbf",
                                                "sense_id": "49bfb3f7-7175-3073-b4e1-bbbcf69da878",
                                                "text": "La racine est tacot, en Bourgogne le nom du battoir à lessive. Tacot vient de taquer que nous trouverons plus loin."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b771c10d-e735-4d9c-9bf0-fc877c1148ad",
                        "source_entry_id": "bf075cee-d577-389f-b6ef-8e440a9c99e7",
                        "source_sense_description": "unreliable mechanical device",
                        "target_lang_word": "teuf-teuf",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "teuf-teuf",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5d9877d-f656-3285-8ed0-98b9a62b8fa4",
                                        "entry_id": "5bf42144-e412-3584-b583-ff59fd3e7048",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bruit d’un moteur à explosion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15de479f-0dcf-4b64-a3f5-33fd8b9abaf7",
                                                "sense_id": "f5d9877d-f656-3285-8ed0-98b9a62b8fa4",
                                                "text": "Quand une pompe paraît à l’horizon, sa silhouette de télégraphe Chappe bat la mesure pour rien. Son teuf-teuf paisible se semble faire aucun bruit, mais s’amalgamer au silence de l’univers, qu’il ponctue à peine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "099f839b-c17e-42ac-a1fd-fc38fca81f33",
                                                "sense_id": "f5d9877d-f656-3285-8ed0-98b9a62b8fa4",
                                                "text": "Vers les trois heures, le teuf-teuf d’une barque à moteur se fait entendre, et un canot de six mètres vient longer les piles de l’embarcadère."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a53175be-f790-3571-a5cc-250ed4a673ce",
                                        "entry_id": "5bf42144-e412-3584-b583-ff59fd3e7048",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Véhicule à moteur pas très puissant ou plus très neuf."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86c18247-dbae-4235-a410-44d91b8c2ac7",
                                                "sense_id": "a53175be-f790-3571-a5cc-250ed4a673ce",
                                                "text": "Dans ma teuf-teuf mobile.\nQui m'emmène au boulot.\nJ'fais des chansons débiles.\nSur des tempos dingos.\nPeu importe le style.\nPeu importent les mots."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
